M4.23 pre-install remote row query diagnosis
Date: 2026-08-28

Error image
-----------
The first post-backup independent verification command exited nonzero without
printing accepted archive evidence.

Cause
-----
The command assumed a field order for `rclone lsf --format sp` and used that
assumption to select the exact remote archive. The selection or size assertion
failed before the hash output stage. No evidence from that invocation is
credited.

Risk
----
None to the completed local archive or remote object. Every operation in the
failed command was read-only. Installation remains blocked until an exact row,
size and remote stream hash are verified successfully.

Rollback
--------
No server rollback is required. This diagnosis can be reverted with the M4.23
deployment-evidence branch.

Approved continuation
---------------------
Print only the exact named remote row with an unambiguous delimiter, inspect
the literal field order, then repeat local/remote size and SHA-256 comparison
using that observed format.
